OL,3,AOutspoken Indian actor Nana Patekar
OL,4,Asuddenly dies at 75
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeteran Indian actor Nana Patekar,
OL,7,Fknown for his intense performances, has
OL,8,Fdied at the age of 75 in Goa.
OL,10,FOne of the most recognisable faces of
OL,11,FIndian cinema, Patekar won three
OL,12,FNational Film Awards and became known
OL,13,Ffor playing difficult and often
OL,14,Fvolatile characters. He was also a
OL,15,Fprominent figure in Marathi language
OL,16,Fcinema and theatre.
OL,18,FHe was admitted to a hospital after
OL,19,Fbeing found unconscious at his home in
OL,20,FGoa in the early hours of Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
